# EmptyState

> Lede 0.8.1's docs for EmptyState, installed with it. Setup, and every item in the release: [README.md](README.md). Online: https://lede.cloudcompute.com/reference/empty-state.md

A quiet `<section>` for a place with nothing in it: a heading, one sentence and at most one action.

## Install

```bash
npx shadcn@latest add @lede/empty-state @lede/button
```

The command needs Lede's registry in `components.json`, as [README.md](README.md#use-it-in-a-shadcn-project) shows. It also installs the items [`lede-theme`](lede-theme.md) and [`lede-utils`](lede-utils.md). It adds [`button`](https://lede.cloudcompute.com/reference/button.md) only because the example below imports it. The item's JSON, with each file's source, is https://lede.cloudcompute.com/r/v0.8.1/empty-state.json.

## Import

```tsx
import { EmptyState } from '@/components/lede/blocks/empty-state';
```

